    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621790/extras/5e8ff9ac11030136aca1196ccc89618b.avif?t=1707499349\" width=600 height=131 /></span><br><br>In Project Hybrid, you'll find yourself ensnared, desperately seeking an escape while unraveling the enigma of your surroundings and the mysterious circumstances that brought you here.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621790/extras/e36968598ebae2b1154da8f0abfffee3.avif?t=1707499349\" width=600 height=131 /></span><br><br>Story to uncover<br><br>Multiple endings<br><br>Escape room like puzzles<br><br>labyrinth's<br><br>Monsters/ human experiments <br><br>Video camera<br><br>UV light<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621790/extras/9c4c77b8e1a2617e23e8df68ba92f6ad.avif?t=1707499349\" width=600 height=131 /></span><br><br>You find yourself on a boat, and suddenly, you discover that you are confined within a cell. Now, you must unravel the mysteries surrounding your unexpected imprisonment and devise a plan to escape. Uncover the secrets that led to your confinement and understand the reasons behind this perplexing situation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621790/extras/921d6824a500cd2b5c05055cd40c45da.avif?t=1707499349\" width=600 height=131 /></span><br><br><strong>EPILEPSY WARNING</strong><br><br>Warning: Please read before playing this game:<br><br>Some individuals may be susceptible to epileptic seizures or loss of consciousness triggered by exposure to certain flashing lights and moving patterns in everyday life. This susceptibility can extend to activities like watching television images or playing specific video games. It is crucial to note that such reactions may occur even in individuals with no prior medical history of epilepsy or seizures.<br><br>Precautions:<br><br>If you or any member of your family has experienced symptoms related to epilepsy (seizures or loss of consciousness) when exposed to flashing lights or moving patterns, it is strongly advised to consult a doctor before engaging in this game.<br>Should you or your family experience any symptoms of seizure during gameplay, such as dizziness, nausea, or loss of consciousness, it is imperative to cease playing immediately and seek prompt medical attention.<br><br>Safety First:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Prioritize your well-being and exercise caution, especially if you have a history of adverse reactions to visual stimuli.<br><br></li><li>Take regular breaks during gameplay to reduce the risk of discomfort or adverse effects.<br><br></li><li>Adjust the game settings to minimize potential triggers, if available.<br><br></li><li>By adhering to these precautions, you can ensure a safer and more enjoyable gaming experience.</li></ul>",
